<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S9" title="In Fighting Hallucinations with Counterfactuals: Diffusion-Guided Perturbations for LVLM Hallucination Suppression" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">9 </span>Details of GPT-4V Aided Evaluation on LLaVA-Bench</span></a></li>
</ol></nav>
